---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Live Art Performance | Holly Alaine Arts">
  <section class="live-art-page">
    <h1>Live Art Performance</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      I am searching for musicians that would like to be painted live at an upcoming performance
      this Fall/Winter! I create either group figure paintings or portraits of performers on stage
      during shows.
    </p>

    <p>
      It is optional to buy the painting after I create it live (which could be used for album art,
      merch, etc.), but I do ask for hourly pay for the performance! It&rsquo;s a unique and
      engaging experience for audiences to watch live art and live music at the same time!
    </p>

    <h2>Past Performances</h2>

    <ul class="performance-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Night Oat (Oat Couture):</strong> Mindful Drones
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Ottawa Grassroots Festival:</strong>
        Meredith Moon, Alysha Brilla, and Irish Millie
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Ottawa Concerts Sunday Series &ndash; Ottawa Tennis Club Cameron Resto-Bar:</strong>
 Moonfruits, Anna Ludlow, Lynne Hanson,
        Jessica Pearson and the East Wind, Raphael Weinroth-Browne
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .live-art-page {
    max-width: 42rem;
    padding: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .live-art-page h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .live-art-page h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }

  .live-art-page p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }

  .performance-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .performance-list li {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    background: #f4f2ec;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .performance-list strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
